      "contextBefore": "```swift\nvar extendedDynamicRangeOutput: Bool { get set }\n```",
      "contextAfter": "If the Metal layer that this [`RealityRenderer`](realityrenderer.md) will be rendering into has been configured to output extended dynamic range content (i.e. the property `QuartzCore/CAMetalLayer/wantsExtendedDynamicRangeContent` on the target `QuartzCore/CAMetalLayer` has been set to `true` and a pixel format that supports EDR content has been set), this property should be set to `true` so that [`RealityRenderer`](realityrenderer.md) adjusts its tone mapping accordingly.",
